REQUIRE VERSION "1.15"
INCLUDE life_cell

# SMX mesh LIFE_FORCE MI2335: LCAT after ABCG1 on sterol RCT limb.
# Continuum ...->dhcr7->dhcr24->soat1->nceh1->abca1->abcg1->lcat (LCAT after ABCG1)
# Gift: LCAT esterifies ABCG1-delivered FC into CE-rich HDL cores under ASSERT so RCT free energy keeps flowing without hollow FC shell.
# Domain: post-ABCG1 plasma HDL-maturation cholesteryl-ester core packing LCAT ward.
# Cube is SoT. Free energy must flow. Not a dual ladder.

ENTITY mesh OF Cell 1 55 0
ENTITY cargo OF Cell 1 36 0
ENTITY lysed OF Cell 0 12 0

SEND mesh set_threshold 9
SEND cargo set_threshold 11

SEND mesh pulse 3
SEND mesh photosynth 28
SEND mesh glycolyse 20
SEND mesh charge 26
SEND mesh feed 20
GETF mesh energy
ASSERT LAST_N >= 16 "mesh energy"
GETF mesh atp
ASSERT LAST_N >= 16 "mesh atp"

